        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Wald-Guard – An Emotional Adventure as a Bumblebee</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Wald-Guard</i>, you step into the role of a tiny bumblebee and embark on an emotional journey. Each chapter is a meticulously crafted, linear platforming experience with plenty of room for exploration and surprises. What the chapters truly mean? That remains a secret 🤐.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Jump without Run</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the ground = death. As a bumblebee, you must navigate the parkour by flying. But beware: your air jumps are limited, and when they run out, you faaaalllllLLL down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: How do you recharge them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A:</strong> Simply touch a wall, and you can keep flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/d52d281e1f95b41d9f606ab4018bbe32.poster.avif?t=1783623678\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/d52d281e1f95b41d9f606ab4018bbe32.webm?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/d52d281e1f95b41d9f606ab4018bbe32.mp4?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Hearts 💕</strong>Gather hearts to increase your maximum number of air jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/83db22b6ba6d46bbfaa79c7fdf2acedc.poster.avif?t=1783623678\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/83db22b6ba6d46bbfaa79c7fdf2acedc.webm?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/83db22b6ba6d46bbfaa79c7fdf2acedc.mp4?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each chapter also hides collectibles that unlock cool hats for your bumblebee, exclusive artwork, and old sketches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/7ce4b78ceb56b9ed7a3faecbfac44685.poster.avif?t=1783623678\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/7ce4b78ceb56b9ed7a3faecbfac44685.webm?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/7ce4b78ceb56b9ed7a3faecbfac44685.mp4?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Co-op for Up to 4 Players!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just connect up to 4 controllers and experience the adventure together with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/4743c382be4cd8638e6503b09e85ecb1.poster.avif?t=1783623678\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/4743c382be4cd8638e6503b09e85ecb1.webm?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/4743c382be4cd8638e6503b09e85ecb1.mp4?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Early Access</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, <i>Wald-Guard</i> is still in Early Access, but you can already play the first act with 8 full chapters. Be curious, explore the world, and uncover the secrets!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Wald-Guard – An Emotional Adventure as a Bumblebee</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Wald-Guard</i>, you step into the role of a tiny bumblebee and embark on an emotional journey. Each chapter is a meticulously crafted, linear platforming experience with plenty of room for exploration and surprises. What the chapters truly mean? That remains a secret 🤐.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Jump without Run</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the ground = death. As a bumblebee, you must navigate the parkour by flying. But beware: your air jumps are limited, and when they run out, you faaaalllllLLL down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: How do you recharge them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A:</strong> Simply touch a wall, and you can keep flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/d52d281e1f95b41d9f606ab4018bbe32.poster.avif?t=1783623678\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/d52d281e1f95b41d9f606ab4018bbe32.webm?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/d52d281e1f95b41d9f606ab4018bbe32.mp4?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Hearts 💕</strong>Gather hearts to increase your maximum number of air jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/83db22b6ba6d46bbfaa79c7fdf2acedc.poster.avif?t=1783623678\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/83db22b6ba6d46bbfaa79c7fdf2acedc.webm?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/83db22b6ba6d46bbfaa79c7fdf2acedc.mp4?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each chapter also hides collectibles that unlock cool hats for your bumblebee, exclusive artwork, and old sketches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/7ce4b78ceb56b9ed7a3faecbfac44685.poster.avif?t=1783623678\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/7ce4b78ceb56b9ed7a3faecbfac44685.webm?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/7ce4b78ceb56b9ed7a3faecbfac44685.mp4?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Co-op for Up to 4 Players!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just connect up to 4 controllers and experience the adventure together with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/4743c382be4cd8638e6503b09e85ecb1.poster.avif?t=1783623678\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/4743c382be4cd8638e6503b09e85ecb1.webm?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/extras/4743c382be4cd8638e6503b09e85ecb1.mp4?t=1783623678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Early Access</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, <i>Wald-Guard</i> is still in Early Access, but you can already play the first act with 8 full chapters. Be curious, explore the world, and uncover the secrets!</p>",
